From: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] transport: add Mihomo ShadowTLS inbound and outbound

Port ShadowTLS v1/v2/v3 framing and authentication from Mihomo v1.19.32.
Add RAW/TCP security settings, metacubex uTLS client fingerprints, certificate
verification, multi-user v3 authentication and SNI-selected handshake servers.
Bound handshakes, cancel pending connections when listeners close, and retain
Xray routing and socket options. ShadowTLS does not encrypt inner payloads;
use an encrypted inner protocol. Native UDP is not wrapped by ShadowTLS.

Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>

